### Spring AI — spring-ai-getting-started
# Requires a valid model API key (e.g. OPENAI_API_KEY) set as an env var
# before starting the app. Calls may cost money — check your provider's tier.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### Simple chat
GET {{host}}/api/chat?message=What is Spring Boot in one sentence?

### Chat with a system persona (expert mode)
GET {{host}}/api/chat/expert?topic=dependency injection

### Streaming chat (Server-Sent Events) — tokens arrive incrementally
GET {{host}}/api/chat/stream?message=Explain reactive programming briefly
Accept: text/event-stream

### Prompt controller — recipe example
GET {{host}}/api/prompt/recipe

### Prompt controller — review example
GET {{host}}/api/prompt/review
